{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Fully detach enums and map keys**\n\nThe copy still shares enum instances and every map key. A transform or custom exporter can mutate a stateful enum or mutable key and thereby alter the cached input or records sent to later exporters, contradicting the isolation guarantee. Normalize enums to JSON scalars and rebuild keys using the mapper's key-serialization semantics; add mutable-enum and mutable-key tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNyj7","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":66,"observation_digest":"a41a7d067d6edab7f9759249d37e95871fe1bf1ea8f5b4b4de506b53333132dd","observation_id":"aro_v1_uqnh2bt5n3nlp6lvsje5g7uvq4","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iee7bcnfj7lcytdfodx5mvljjs","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"ce1de5fa37a2da2f6805802585eeee8390944531","reviewer":"codex","start_line":60,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_z3a2wbiy4vfcfzbdybljcjvrrx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
